    {
      "id": "130000006700",
      "name": "Awaken",
      "effect": {
        "origEffect": {
          "description": "When close to death, very greatly restore HP, boost movement speed, and STR/ DEF/ MND +50% (once per wave).",
          "note": "+2 Movement Speed.\n{HEAL:0:840%:600:100%}",
          "warning": ""
        },
        "lakeEffect": {
          "description": "While HP is at 30% or less,  activate the following to self (Once Per Wave):{:}{#}Heal {~}{HEAL:0:840%:600:100%}{~} HP.{##}{#}Apply the following buffs:{:}{#}{BUFF:30000:40}{~}+{STR:50%}{~} STR{<}{##}{#}{BUFF:30100:40}{~}+{DEF:50%}{~} DEF{<}{##}{#}{BUFF:30300:40}{~}+{MND:50%}{~} MND{<}{##}{#}{BUFF:31000:40}{~}+2{~} Movement Speed{<}{##}{::}{##}{::}",
          "note": "{HEAL:0:840%:600:100%}\n{!}{=}Lake:{=} Do note that this effect will heal up to 9999 only. It's only possible to heal further by increasing the Healing Cap, but all such effects will affect Active Abilities only.\nInstead, the high healing values are useful for situations such as being debuffed.{!!}Also, a commonly asked question is whether or not this skill stacks with other similar 'Close to Death' effects.{!}The short answer is yes.{:}{#}Originally, all 'Close to Death' effects will activate at the same time that the condition is met.{:}{#}This behavior worked well for lots of effects, but it was crippling for lifesaving effects like Awaken which heals HP.{##}{#}Therefore, on May 12, 2022, this behavior was changed.{##}{::}{##}{#}All 'Close to Death' effects will activate sequentially with the order being: Trait > Passive Skills > Equips > Ark Ability.{:}{#}If multiple effects are within the same category, they'll be activated based on an internal order.{##}{#}If an effect heals the Unit's HP above the 'Close to Death' mark, then the Unit is no longer close to death and the remaining effects won't activate.{##}{::}{##}{::}",
          "warning": ""
        },
